# Day 5 - Anatomy of a Great Prompt

## What are the 6 parts of a great prompt?

1. 🎭 Role

Tell the AI who it should be.

Example:

You are a Python mentor.

You are a marketing expert.

2. 🎯 Task

Tell the AI what to do.

Example:

Explain Python.3. 📖 Context

Give background information.

Example:

I am a complete beginner.

I have 3 hours a day.

3. 📖 Context

Give background information.

Example:

I am a complete beginner.

I have 3 hours a day.

Create a business plan.


4. 📏 Constraints

Set limits or requirements.

Example:

Use simple English.
Keep it under 300 words.
Use only free tools.

5. 📄 Output Format

Tell the AI how to present the answer.

Example:

Bullet points
Table
Weekly roadmap

6. 🎯 Goal

Explain why you're asking.

Example:

My goal is to earn my first freelance income.

## Why are they important?

Because it gives AI enough information what we wanna do or as a result AI response good.
#mistake-They are important because they give the AI clear instructions, enough context, and a specific goal, helping it generate more accurate and useful responses.

## My Prompt

Write one complete prompt using all 6 parts.

Role - You are Business Tycon. Whose business is develop AI apps for daily easy use for people and you also a motivational speeacher. 
Taske - Explain me how an AI business is grow with your experience.
Context - I am a AI freelnacer who right now a completely beginner in AI industry and wanted to earn first dollar with AI. So mentor me how can I do it. I can give 3 hour a day in learing.
Constraints - Use simple language in HINDI and ENGLISH which is eary for me to understand. Also suggets me free websites to practice or learn.
Output Format - Make a weekly roadmap and aslo gives short notes which is for my revision. 
Goal - I want to make online money with AI. So I can become self made indendent person. When you prepare roadmap also try to create a roadmap which maximise my chances to earn before 30 september and later I become a self made business Tycon in AI and become your rivel in AI industry.

